      "statement": "Migration 0027 enabled RLS on tables existing at that time via a loop, so later tables must enable RLS and add policies themselves; policies wrap app.* calls in (SELECT ...) for once-per-query evaluation. 0047_document_links.sql is a model: enable RLS, grant SELECT, a policy tied to the parent documents row, and the log_catalog_write trigger.",
