      "statement": "Router code takes PoolDep, a CallerPool: each connection is one transaction that first sets the Postgres role (anon or authenticated, anon when unauthenticated), request.jwt.claims and the REST statement timeout with SET LOCAL, so RLS and grants apply to the route and the connection returns to the pool as the owner. OwnerPoolDep is the owner pool used by identity and staff/Import code, which bypasses RLS.",
